### About Me

I am **Doncy Grace Mohan**, a second-year Bachelor of Computer Applications (BCA) student (Semester 3) at **Kristu Jyothi College of Management and Technology, Kottayam**. I am passionate about technology, software development, marketing, and community building. Currently, I serve as the **Campus Lead of μLearn KJCMT**, where I actively organize technical events, encourage student participation, and help build a strong learning community.

I enjoy exploring emerging technologies, contributing to open-source projects, and collaborating with like-minded people to create innovative solutions. My interests include IoT, embedded systems, cloud technologies, and software development. Through μFIFA, I hope to sharpen my technical skills, learn from talented peers, build meaningful projects, and represent Portugal with dedication and teamwork.

